<h1>How Dekopon works</h1>
<p>Two local processes connect chat and models to a controlled shell runtime and permissioned services.</p>
</header>
<nav class="guide-jumps" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#processes">What runs where</a><a href="#configure">What you configure</a><a href="#follow">Follow a request</a>
